    "description": "Super Classic Nokia Ringtones are free ringtones for all Android mobile devices.\r\nUnleash the best original free ringtones, Nokia ringtones and old phone ringtones to remember the nostalgic days of the golden age of mobile phones.\r\nTimeless classic Nokia ringtones to remember the nostalgic time, this is forever golden time, let go and enjoy with family and friends.\r\nIt's free for Android friends, don't lose the chance to go back in time and restore your memories with the nostalgic golden days.\r\n\r\nFunction:\r\n- Massive classic Nokia ringtones.\r\n- Small size MP3 files with high quality sound effects.\r\n- Free set ringtone as default ringtone, alarm clock, contact ringtone, notification.\r\n- Regular update, more Nokia ringtones are waiting for you.\r\n- Support various national languages, English, Bengali, German, French, Hindi, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, Russian, Turkish, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese...\r\n\r\nInstructions:\r\nOpen this application and you can press the \"Play\" button to listen to MP3 music. If you like one of these MP3 music, you can set it as your default phone ringtone, alarm or notification.",
